			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2735445">
									

<p>Nice work, Wils. I read about halfway through this and thought &quot;wow, going for the downer ending&quot;, but then you made it genuinely nasty. And I think this actually improves the skip, which otherwise felt a bit disconnected from this series. Certainly a very effective bit of emotional manipulation, which is evident in the reactions here!</p>
<p>Having finished reading, I thought I'd need to go back and try to work out how the magician did his trick. Good to know that we might get a &quot;behind the scenes&quot; follow-up, <em>Wild Things</em> credits-style.</p>

